{"id":"W4db42de72f56349f12f41af4","zh":"数论选点法","en":"","name":"数论选点法","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W4db42de72f56349f12f41af4","text":"数论选点法","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S14ab348c60bf71065eed","source_id":"P115","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"由式(13)获取不同轨道不平顺样本谱的概率密度分布,而后采用数论选点法 [14]进行2个随机变量 (高低不平顺和方向不平顺)的样本谱选取和时-频转换。","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":5,"page_end":5}]},{"id":"Sddd62f647eb89e2e70ba","source_id":"P131","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"显然,视轨道不平顺功率谱密度曲线为随机变量,结合图2(a)给出的PDF分布特性曲线,可以采用多种方法实现轨道不平顺代表性功率谱样本的选取,如舍选法 [22]、超立方抽样法 [23]、数论选点法 [24]等。","citations":[{"source_id":"P131","page":4,"page_end":4}]},{"id":"S0fed5e98c67860fe8646","source_id":"P131","page":6,"page_end":6,"language":"zh","text":"将预测结果与实测结果进行对比;而对于其他动力指标,由于缺乏实测值,采用数论选点法 [26],实现4种不平顺类型在不同累计概率下的谱组合,并进行动力仿真,将其计算结果与预测结果进行对比。","citations":[{"source_id":"P131","page":6,"page_end":6}]}],"sources":{"P115":{"id":"P115","title":"轨道不平顺概率模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.19818/j.cnki.1671-1637.2018.03.006","journal_citation":"交通运输工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-track-irregularity-probabilistic-model"},"P131":{"id":"P131","title":"车辆-轨道系统动力极值预测及可靠度计算","authors":"徐磊,朱雪燕,金浩然,刘鹏飞,闫斌,余志武","year":"2024","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20231395","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2024）","overview_slug":"2024-dynamic-extrema-prediction-and-reliability-assessment-of-vehicle-track-coupled-system"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"算例用于选择高低和方向不平顺代表谱的抽样方法。","language":"zh","source_id":"P115","paper_slug":"2018-track-irregularity-probabilistic-model","title":"轨道不平顺概率模型","kind":"paper_u